DESCRIPTION:Tymay Lay is a comedian\, actress\, and writer based in San Die
 go\, best known for her "Dear Diary" and Peggy characters on social media. 
 As a first-generation Vietnamese-American and academic\, Tymay uses her per
 sonal experiences and education to bring her ideas to life whether she’s 
 delivering comedic interpretations of the English language or reimagining d
 rug store product advertisements. With a rapidly growing audience on TikTok
 \, Instagram\, and Facebook\, Tymay Lay is now taking the stage and looking
  forward to connecting with live audiences.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n
